WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:03.100
I did not know how to help my child with what happens in class.

2
00:00:03.400 --> 00:00:06.100
I wanted something other than a bank of exercises.

3
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:09.500
So I created Le Cahier. It sticks to what is being worked on in class.

4
00:00:09.800 --> 00:00:12.357
You add the class plan.

5
00:00:12.657 --> 00:00:14.206
Le Cahier prepares the week from the plan.

6
00:00:14.506 --> 00:00:19.706
One short session a day. A mistake? An explanation.

7
00:00:20.006 --> 00:00:23.039
In one session, a bit of everything, as at school.

8
00:00:23.340 --> 00:00:25.818
Why today? A class test is coming.

9
00:00:26.118 --> 00:00:28.418
No score. No ranking. The child’s answers are encrypted in the browser.

10
00:00:28.718 --> 00:00:31.918
Practice that follows your child’s class.
www.lecahier.ca
